8,Mohegan-Pequot phonology | Aerolian Wiki | Fandom,https://aerolian.fandom.com/wiki/Mohegan-Pequot_phonology,"October 19, 2022 - in: Algic phonologies · Edit · Edit source · History · Talk (0) 1 Consonants · 2 Vowels · 2.1 Monophthongs · 2.2 Diphthongs · 3 See also · 4 External links · /n/ is realized as [ŋ] only before [k]. The nasal /ɔ̃/ sound can range to being an oral /ɔ/ sound. ""a"" written with an acute accent (á) represents a long aː sound. Mohegan-Pequot orthography ·",Mohegan-Pequot,Algic
